WEBVTT

1
00:05.400 --> 00:23.400
01 · The records already exist

2
00:23.400 --> 00:30.200
02 · What needs the vet today? — the answer is a worklist

3
00:30.200 --> 00:34.400
03 · Why can't R-0037 leave?

4
00:34.400 --> 00:41.700
04 · It shows its work: her records, the rules, the person it waits for

5
00:41.700 --> 00:47.200
05 · Ask prepares the next step — and stops

6
00:47.200 --> 00:51.800
06 · A person approves, under their name

7
00:51.800 --> 00:57.000
07 · The record exists · RQ-26-0001 — and enters the x-ray

8
00:57.000 --> 01:04.000
08 · Every decision. On record.
